CLUSION: The Principal's Final Word</h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Sau 15 n=C4=83m experience t=E1=
=BA=A1i c=C3=A1c c=C3=B4ng ty top tier v=C3=A0 countless production inciden=
ts, t=C3=B4i mu=E1=BB=91n leave you v=E1=BB=9Bi the most important insight:=
</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>HTTP method choice kh=C3=
=B4ng ph=E1=BA=A3i l=C3=A0 technical detail - it's architectural decision v=
=E1=BB=9Bi lasting consequences.</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">GET v=C3=A0 POST kh=C3=B4ng ch=
=E1=BB=89 =C4=91=C6=A1n gi=E1=BA=A3n l=C3=A0 "c=C3=A1ch kh=C3=A1c nhau =C4=
=91=E1=BB=83 g=E1=BB=ADi data." They represent fundamentally different phil=
osophies:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>GET</strong>: "I want t=
o observe without changing anything"</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>POST</strong>: "I want =
to perform an action that changes state"</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">M=E1=BB=97i khi b=E1=BA=A1n choo=
se wrong method, b=E1=BA=A1n don't just introduce bugs - b=E1=BA=A1n compro=
mise security, performance, v=C3=A0 user experience. Worse, b=E1=BA=A1n cre=
ate technical debt that compounds over time.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The Principal's Golden R=
ules:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Safety First</strong>: =
GET for safe operations, POST+ for everything else</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Security Always</strong=
>: Sensitive data never goes in URLs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Semantics Matter</stron=
g>: HTTP methods have meaning - respect them</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Counts</str=
ong>: Leverage caching where appropriate</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Team Alignment</strong>=
: Establish clear standards and enforce them</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remember: Code is temporary, but=
 architecture decisions live forever. Choose wisely.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>Stay safe, code smart, v=C3=
=A0 may your APIs be forever RESTful.</em></p>
